  "title": "Forestar Announces Pricing of $500 Million Offering of Senior Unsecured Notes",
  "summary": "Forestar Group Inc. today announced that it has priced an offering of $500 million aggregate principal amount of 6.500% senior unsecured notes due 2033. The Notes were offered and will be sold in a private placement to qualified institutional buyers pursuant to Rule 144 A under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended,",
